sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    box rgba(59,111,216,0.06) Camunda · unchanged
        participant Z as Zeebe
        participant A as AI Agent
    end
    box rgba(240,122,26,0.07) barclays-ai-agent-connector
        participant F as Router + Builder
        participant M as AuthenticatedChatModel
    end
    box rgba(59,111,216,0.06) LangChain4j + AWS SDK
        participant L as BedrockChatModel
    end
    box rgba(240,122,26,0.07) barclays-ai-agent-connector
        participant H as AuthenticatingSdkHttpClient
        participant C as BamTokenCache
    end
    box rgba(34,160,90,0.06) Barclays network
        participant B as BAM
        participant G as Bedrock gateway
    end

    rect rgba(122,90,240,0.07)
        Note over Z,F: PHASE 1 · Build the chat model
        Z->>A: job barclays.ai-gateway:aiagent:1
        A->>F: createChatModel(Bedrock config)
        F->>F: validate custom endpoint
        F-->>A: model with unsigned client
    end

    rect rgba(240,122,26,0.07)
        Note over A,C: PHASE 2 · Pre-flight, fail closed
        A->>+M: chat(request)
        M->>C: getCredentials()
        C-->>M: ok, or throw and send nothing
    end

    rect rgba(34,160,90,0.07)
        Note over M,G: PHASE 3 · Call through the AWS SDK
        M->>+L: chat(request)
        L->>+H: prepareRequest (unsigned)
        H->>C: getCredentials()
        alt token cached and fresh
            C-->>H: headers · lock-free read
        else missing or within 60 s of expiry
            C->>B: GET token-url · Basic auth
            B-->>C: bamToken (JWT)
            C-->>H: headers
        end
        H->>G: POST /model/{id}/converse + x-bam-token
        G-->>H: 200 Converse response
        H-->>-L: response, status unchanged
        L-->>-M: ChatResponse
    end
    M-->>-A: ChatResponse · token usage logged
    A-->>Z: next tool call, or complete the job
